
## Pods
pods are sigle instaces of a running process in a cluster.
Pods contain atleast one container.
they usually run as single container but can run multple containers
Multiple containers are used when two or more containers must share resources

if the pod is unhealthy - for example, if it is stuck in waiting mode or crashing 
repeatedly it is terminated. the mechanism that manages scalling and health monitoring
is known as controller.

# services
if we will use any pod for any work (application) or to
keep it on frontend that type of operation is called service in kubernetes.

## in kubernetes terminology 
pod is an object that provids API endpoints with a stable IP address that 
allow applications to discover pods running a particular application 
kubernetes provides a level of indirection between application 
runnin in pods, And other applications that call them: it is called a 
servcice.

